    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Greeting politely",
     "texto": [
      "**Γεια σου** is informal; **Γεια σας** is used to greet several people or to address one person politely. **Καλημέρα** is used in the morning; **Καλησπέρα** in the afternoon and at dusk.",
      "To say goodbye you can say **Αντίο**. **Παρακαλώ** means «please» and it is also used to reply to «thank you», like «you're welcome»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
